{
  "_doc": "Glossary and ban list. fidelity.py fails on any 'ban' match in the rendered text (both languages) and warns on 'prefer' hits. A ban entry is a string (case-insensitive term, or /regex/flags) or {pattern, flags, use, why}. See references/words.md.",
